  "notes": "New since 0.1.0-37:\n- Workspace import is safer: if the app stops part of the way through an import, the import is undone (or finished, if every file was already in place) the next time the workspace opens, with a note in the activity log. Imports and saves no longer overlap, and an oversized ZIP file is refused before it is read.\n- Pipelines (experimental): a frame grows when a block in it is dragged over its edge, and travels with its blocks when they are copied.\n- Pipelines: a collapsed block shows how many of its hidden blocks have run, and a row in Run results opens the block that hides it.\n- Pipelines: the HTML run report has a \"Save this run as an animated GIF\" link.\n- Pipelines: Start and End can no longer be piped straight together.\n",
